Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:26:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] Verifier V26: no Ctx helper of its own; two more
 settled lot laws

Workstream 18's V0 adds Ctx::unverifiable with the same signature as the
one patch 0006 added, so the two integrated did not compile. V26's
UNVERIFIABLE helpers now live in v26_custody.rs (over Ctx::push) and Ctx
gains nothing from custody.

The state audit also fails a lot whose CONSUMED is above zero while its
NONCE is 0 (only a use order's grantee consumes and every order moves
NONCE on; workstream 9's workshop deposit is such a use), and an open
lot that carries FORFEITED (only forfeit books it, and it leaves the lot
forfeited). tests/custody_state.rs forges both.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C5Nj2cMNVbfXW4D5Pzsbxg
